MOOSEMATERIAL 2
# Walls. Brick has bumps (its normal map) and a highlight (dull on the mortar, by its alpha) and,
# flat, detail noise. Unit values (specular, detail, opacity, strength) are 0-255.
shader             lit
texture0           brick_wall.png
texture1           brick_wall_normal.png
filter1            bilinear
specular           64
shininess          32
detail             26
